==Relegation play-offs==
On March 7, 2018, the Saudi Football Federation announced that the number of teams in the [[Saudi Professional League]] will be increased from 14 teams to 16 teams. The relegation was removed and in its place, they announced a relegation play-off. The bottom 2 teams will face the 3rd and 4th place team in the [[Prince Mohammad bin Salman League]].<ref name="twitter.com"/>

